     1447   FUNCTION mark-string RETURNS CHARACTER
     1448   ( input p-recid as recid, input mark-list as character  )  FORWARD.
     1449   DEFINE MENU MENU-B-add
     1450          MENU-ITEM m_add-shop     LABEL "Магазин"
     1451          MENU-ITEM m_add-store    LABEL "Склад"         .
