     1478        SIZE 10 BY 1.
     1479   DEFINE BUTTON B-db
     1480        IMAGE-UP FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
     1481        IMAGE-DOWN FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
     1482        IMAGE-INSENSITIVE FILE "btn-down-arrow":U
     1483        LABEL ""
     1484        SIZE 3 BY 1.
     1485   DEFINE BUTTON B-del
